      "key": [
        "Equivalent Exchange",
        "Mondstadt special",
        "special beverage"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Charles: Equivalent Exchange",
      "content": "In the World Quest Equivalent Exchange, Charles tells the Traveler and Paimon they look underage and cannot buy wine, but offers a Mondstadt special if the missing ingredients can be recovered. Monsters have wrecked the delivery carts. He mixes what the Traveler salvages into a drink made from apple vinegar, Dandelion, Mint and Berries, best served chilled, and says the first order was meant for new cocktail experiments.",
