      "comment": "Charles: Iridescent Arataki Rockin' for Life Tour de Force of Awesomeness",
      "content": "In the limited-time 4.6 event, the Traveler invited Charles to a music festival in Inazuma. He hummed a song he liked from the Dawn Winery's family concerts, said he would not ask Diluc for a day off over something so trivial, and offered decorative banners from the winery's warehouse as support.",
